 75NI c  Compiled (unevaluated) dataset from 2020Go10 Phys Rev C 102, 044331    
 75NI c  Compiled by E.A. McCutchan (NNDC,BNL) March 1, 2021                    
 75NI c  {+75}Co produced by fragmentation of {+82}Se beam at 140 MeV/nucleon   
 75NI2c  with a {+9}Be target at NSCL facility followed by fragment separation  
 75NI3c  using A1900 fragment separator. Particle identification by energy      
 75NI4c  loss and time-of-flight techniques. The ions were implanted in Ge      
 75NI5c  double-sided silicon strip (GeDSSD) detector for fragment |b           
 75NI6c  detection. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g, |b|g using 8 Clover detectors in   
 75NI7c  close geometry.                                                        
